    "Mac と Windows 10 以降は UTF-8 で読めます。古い Windows や古いソフトに渡すなら Shift_JIS" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Macs and Windows 10 or later can read UTF-8. Choose Shift_JIS for older Windows or older software."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Mac のキーボードの記号と、Windows でだいたい当たるキー" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Mac keyboard symbols and their rough Windows equivalents"
